    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a tool for understanding patterns in the world, especially through physics and art. My upper secondary education gave me a solid foundation, but I’m still building confidence. I enjoy applying it to real-world problems like physics simulations and creative projects, though I sometimes feel overwhelmed by abstract concepts.",
